  "bodyHash": "89cd95f6efd8ba5c",
  "content": "\n\n<p>补充了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faC3cM3Vq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks</a> 的功能，并添加了来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fu5Ic2U1u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Wheelie</a> 的更多鼠标操作功能。</p>\n<h3>功能调整</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>ALT+鼠标左键</code> 丢弃当前槽位 <ul>\n<li>相当于 <code>CTRL+Q</code></li>\n<li>支持鼠标拖拽</li></ul></li>\n<li><code>CTRL+鼠标左键</code> 快速移动所有匹配槽位 <ul>\n<li>相当于 <code>SHIFT+双击左键</code></li>\n<li>支持鼠标拖拽</li>\n<li>可按标签忽略物品组件数据</li>\n<li><code>CTRL+ALT+鼠标左键</code> 丢弃所有匹配槽位</li></ul></li>\n<li>页面滚动 <ul>\n<li>合成书页面</li>\n<li>合成书标签页</li>\n<li>创造模式物品栏标签页</li></ul></li>\n<li>通过 <code>鼠标右键</code> 快速合成与交易 <ul>\n<li><code>SHIFT+鼠标右键</code> 用于批量合成或交易</li>\n<li>可配置合成溢出行为</li></ul></li>\n<li>通过 <code>Q</code>（丢弃）键快速合成</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>依赖项</h3>\n<p>Fabric： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faC3cM3Vq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MouseTweaks</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fP7dR8mSH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p>\n<p>NeoForge： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faC3cM3Vq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MouseTweaks</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p>\n<h3>鸣谢</h3>\n<p>MoreMouseTweaks 在许可协议下使用了 <a href=\"https://github.com/Siphalor/mouse-wheelie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Wheelie</a>（作者：<a href=\"https://github.com/Siphalor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Siphalor</a>）的代码。</p>\n<h3>相关模组</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fS8drsznD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClientSort</a> - 物品栏排序快捷键。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ft5wuYk45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tweakeroo</a> - 手部补货、自动切换工具、防止工具损坏（以及更多功能）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>联系方式</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&label=Discord Server&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord Server\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks?logo=github&label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub Issues\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks?label=License&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>",
